 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Agreeing and disagreeing",
     "texto": [
      "**Sependapat** and **sejalan** express that you share an opinion. **Keberatan dengan** introduces an objection; it is good to explain the reason without attacking someone who thinks differently.",
      "Indonesian does not use a different verb form for \"I\" and \"she\": the context identifies the person."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Politeness in a letter",
     "texto": [
      "A criticism can be firm and at the same time **santun**. The **kesantunan** depends on the choice of words and on how the request is presented. Avoid expressions that could **menyinggung** the person receiving the letter."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
